			"notes": "## 🎉 Feature\n1. Support `1.21.5+`  \n\n## ⚡️ Improvement\n1. Improve day counter rendering logic\n\n**Important**: \nMojang do a lot of breaking changes in `1.21.x`, which make mod file name looks confusing, this table shows which file should you download for your game version.  \n\n**A simple rule: Download the most near version that lower than your game version**  \nFor example, `1.21.8` should download `clock-hud_1.21.6-1.1.10.jar` and `1.19.4` should download `clock-hud_1.19-1.1.10.jar`\n\n|Your Game Version|Game Version in file name|\n|:---:|:---:|\n|1.21.6 ~ 1.21.8 |1.21.6|\n|1.21.5|1.21.5|\n|1.21.2 ~ 1.21.4|1.21.2|\n|1.21 ~ 1.21.1|1.21|\n|1.20.x|1.20|\n|1.19.x|1.19|\n|1.18.x|1.18|\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/KawaiiZapic/ClockHUD/compare/1.1.9...1.1.10"
